    \u0447\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0437 {0}..."
  - "J\xE6gerne kommer om {0}..."
  - Jegerne kommer om {0}...
  - "Mets\xE4st\xE4j\xE4t tulevat {0}..."
  - "A vad\xE1szok {0}\_m\xFAlva j\xF6nnek..."
  - "Lovci vyraz\xED za {0}..."
  - "Avc\u0131lar {0}\_saniye sonra geliyor..."
  - "V\xE2n\u0103torii vin \xEEn {0}..."
  - "Th\u1EE3 s\u0103n \u0111\u1EBFn sau {0}..."
